  #line-at(342.79pt, 103.58pt, "2024) and viscoplastic (Sanjay ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(498.1pt, 103.58pt, "et al. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 124.34pt, "2021) media. These studies show how the interplay between elastic stress relaxation and yield ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 144.98pt, "stress profoundly alters the transient cavity collapse events and the subsequent formation and ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 165.74pt, "evolution of the jet. However, the physics of these events for elastic fluids (Boger fluids), ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 186.38pt, "which is the subject matter of our investigation, remains completely uncharted territory in ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 207.14pt, "literature.  ")
  #line-at(108.02pt, 235.82pt, "To analyze the transient flow dynamics and the influence of viscoelastic behavior of ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 256.61pt, "polymeric liquids, the quantification of the extensional rheological properties of this class of ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 277.25pt, "fluids is necessary. In particular, the Capillary Breakup Extensional Rheometer (CaBER) ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 298.01pt, "(Bazilevsky ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(134.06pt, 298.01pt, "et al. ")
