  #line-at(262.25pt, 318.65pt, "2015) are used to measure the extensional rheological ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 339.29pt, "properties of dilute or semi-dilute polymer liquids. In recent developments, instruments such ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 360.05pt, "as Dripping-onto-Substrate (DoS) rheometer is applied to measure the elasticity of biological ")
