  #line-at(72.024pt, 719.98pt, "the thinning dynamics of the elongated Worthington jets. In § 5, we validate our simulations ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 740.62pt, "using our experiments, present the evolution of the elastic stress tensor in the liquid filament, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 761.4pt, "and the velocity field during cavity and jet evolution from the numerical analysis. The § 3-5 ")
]

