  #line-at(72.024pt, 82.92pt, "Therefore, it is often applied accurately for the modelling of dilute polymer solutions, in ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 103.58pt, "which interaction between polymer molecules is negligible. As a thorough survey of literature ")
