  #line-at(72.024pt, 379.61pt, "capillary-wave propagation is delayed, reducing the maximum jet height. Further, elastic ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 400.37pt, "stresses oppose capillary-driven necking, thereby suppressing rapid pinch-off and producing ")
