  #line-at(72.024pt, 235.94pt, "reduction indicates that ~35% of the initial kinetic energy is stored (0.8 in 0D-0P case and ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 256.61pt, "0.45 in 500D-500P case) in the form of elastic energy by the polymer molecules (present in ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 277.37pt, "the system) stretching due to shear along with the cavity expansion process. ")
  #line-at(108.02pt, 306.05pt, "Now the question naturally arises, that since the absorbed energy comprises of elastic ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 326.69pt, "energy stored in the polymer molecules of both the impacting droplet and the target pool, can ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 347.45pt, "the relative contributions be mapped? To segregate the quantum of contribution of the ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 368.09pt, "polymer chains within the droplet, the intermediate configurations, 0D-500P and 500D-0P, ")
