  #line-at(72.024pt, 412.25pt, "energy is utilized towards cavity expansion processes. Herein, since the impacting droplet is ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 432.91pt, "devoid of polymers, its contribution towards elastic energy storage is zero. Consequently, this ")
