  #line-at(72.024pt, 165.74pt, "confined to the immediate vicinity of the cavity floor, while the velocity decays rapidly with ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 186.38pt, "increasing distance from the cavity. This observation supports the assumption of Prosperetti ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 207.14pt, "& Oguz 1993; that the velocity field vanishes simultaneously in the pool. From the velocity ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 227.78pt, "contours of the upward-moving jet at 50 ms, it is evident that the velocity at the jet tip is ")
