  #line-at(72.024pt, 354.77pt, "onto a pool of elastic fluid, using detailed experiments, theoretical analysis and computer ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 375.53pt, "simulations. Our objective, and motivation has been to understand the role of fluid elasticity ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 396.17pt, "(in terms of elastic energy storage and polymer relaxation), capillarity and inertia in the fluid ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 416.93pt, "dynamic processes of cavity formation and collapse, crown formation, and growth and ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 437.59pt, "breakup of the Worthington jet, and the associated filament elasto-hydrodynamics. In ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 458.35pt, "particular, we demonstrate that the conversion of the droplet's initial kinetic energy into ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 478.99pt, "elastic energy, manifested via polymer chain stretching, significantly alters the impact ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 499.75pt, "dynamics by suppressing crown breakup, reducing cavity size and growth rates, and delaying ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 520.39pt, "jet evolution. We have observed distinct events, depending on the various droplet-pool ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 541.15pt, "combinations (water droplet-water pool, elastic fluid droplet-water pool, water droplet- ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 562.87pt, "elastic fluid pool, and elastic fluid droplet- elastic fluid pool), and governing ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 13.099pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(463.111pt, 562.831pt, "De")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(477.788pt, 562.831pt, " and ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 13.099pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(502.277pt, 562.831pt, "We")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(518.314pt, 562.831pt, " , ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 583.75pt, "yielding four distinct regimes. ")
  #line-at(108.02pt, 612.46pt, "We put forward a theoretical estimation of the percentage of the initial kinetic energy ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 633.1pt, "of droplet that is converted into elastic energy during impact. As the polymer concentration ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 653.86pt, "increases, more than ~30% of the initial kinetic energy may be stored as elastic energy via ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 674.5pt, "polymer chain stretching during cavity expansion phase. This conversion of kinetic energy ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 695.26pt, "into elastic energy suppresses crown breakup, and the formation of secondary droplets. For a ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 716.98pt, "given ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 13.099pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(104.827pt, 716.93pt, "We")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(120.864pt, 716.93pt, " , the cavity size decreases with increasing polymer concentration owing to the ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 737.86pt, "enhanced conversion of kinetic energy into elastic energy. In particular, we obtain that the ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 759pt, "thinning of stretched Worthington jet radius follows the scaling  ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12.574pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(436.882pt, 758.99pt, "(")
  #line-at(444.912pt, 758.99pt, ")")
  #line-at(460.945pt, 758.99pt, "exp(")
  #line-at(495.086pt, 758.99pt, "/ 2")
  #line-at(514.281pt, 758.99pt, ")")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12.574pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(431.46pt, 758.99pt, "r")
  #line-at(440.779pt, 758.99pt, "t")
  #line-at(488.943pt, 758.99pt, "t")
